'''Hades the Punisher''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] added in [[Version 9.4 Update|Version 9.4]]. He can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[The Almighties The Majestic Zeus (Gacha Event)|The Almighties The Majestic Zeus]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]] gains immunity to Knockback and Slow effects. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 9.10 Update|Version 9.10]], and Ultra Talents were added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]].

