==Trivia==
*Hades is the [[wikipedia:Hades|King of the Underworld]] in Greek Mythology.
*Hades' armor being made of three dog heads is a reference to [[wikipedia:Cerberus|Cerberus]].
*The miniature riverman rowing the boat on the smoke trail is a reference to [[wikipedia:Charon|Charon]] and the [[wikipedia:Styx|River Styx]].
*Hades the Deathdealer has the highest health of all [[Cat Units]].
*The flower on the rightmost platform references [[Wikipedia:Persephone|Persephone]], the Goddess of Spring and Hades' wife.

